BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poets in Play featuring Scott Williams - The ARTS Council of the S
 outhern Finger Lakes
DTSTART:20261111T000000Z
DTEND:20261111T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T170003Z
UID:0c47b29d801563d5b77bf10ba52610d9fdcd92b6@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Literature,Connection,Virtual,BIPOC
DESCRIPTION:The ARTS Council of the Southern Finger Lakes (The ARTS Counci
 l) invites you to Poets in Play featuring Scott Williams on Tuesday\, Nove
 mber 10\, from 7-9pm.\nJoin us at The ARTS Council\, 79 West Market St.\, 
 in Corning\, NY\, or on Zoom for Scott's reading. An open mic opportunity 
 for in-person poets will immediately follow the featured reading. Poets\, 
 read a poem based on Scott's prompt or something of your own selection.\nP
 rompt: "The place had those white stone stairs that housewives washed as f
 requent as underwear."\nZoom Info: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86496002708\n
 This event is free and open to the public.\nAbout Scott:\nScott was born o
 n Staten Island\, NY and raised in Baltimore\, MD. He has a PhD in mathema
 tics from Lehigh University. Scott was also awarded the status of Professo
 r Emeritus at the University at Buffalo. He has over 60 poems published in
  magazines and newspapers as well as 7 published books. Scott runs his own
  monthly poetry series in Geneva\, NY.\nQuestions?\nEmail Director of Publ
 ic Programs\, Casey Winston\, at casey@eARTS.org.\nPoets in Play is presen
 ted in partnership with FootHills Publishing.\nFunding for this event is g
 enerously provided by The Newbury Giving Fund.\n__\nPhoto provided by Scot
 t Williiams.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/ev
 ent/78507591/20261110190000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78507591/20261110190000
END:VEVENT
