DESCRIPTION:Test your FLX knowledge & win a prize for a nonprofit particip
 ating in FLX Gives! Teams of up to 8 people are invited to join us for FLX
  Gives style trivia where winning prizes will go directly to a nonprofit p
 articipating in the 24-hour fundraiser. Hosted by Bulldog Sounds\, teams w
 ill register upon arrival and select a participating nonprofit to play for
 !\n1st place prize: $1\,000 for a participating nonprofit\n2nd place prize
 : $500 for a participating nonprofit\n3rd place price: $250 for a particip
 ating nonprofit\nFLX (Finger Lakes) Gives\, an initiative of the Community
