DESCRIPTION:Join us on Thursdays\, 10 AM - 2 PM\, from November through Ma
 rch at the Bridge to Hope Center at 37 Bridget Street for the Corning Wint
 er Farmers Market! The Market will feature a curated array of regional agr
 icultural producers\, artisans and crafters\, local baked goods\, and more
 .\nMarket visitors are able to use (and double) their SNAP benefits throug
 h our participation in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP
