DESCRIPTION:The Snowy Day and Other Stories\nA Sensory-Friendly Performanc
 e\nSaturdayNovember 21\, 2026\, 2:00pm\nOpen to All\nRunning Time: 50 mins
 \, plus a 10 min Talk Back\nAge Recommendation: All Ages\nShare:\nPricing
 \nFacility maintenance fees apply.\nGeneral Admission Tickets:\n$15 Adult
