 esday-Wednesday\, December 8 – 9\, 2026\, @ 7:30pm\nSeason tickets on sa
 le now at ClemensCenter.org\nIndividual tickets will be on sale at a later
  date\n---------------\nHe earned his stripes on Broadway… now the ghost
 -with-the-most is coming to Elmira.\nIt’s showtime! Based on Tim Burton
 ’s dearly beloved film\, this hilarious musical tells the story of Lydia
  Deetz\, a strange and unusual teenager whose whole life changes when she 
 meets a recently deceased couple and a demon with a thing for stripes. Wit
 h an irreverent book and a score that’s out of this Netherworld\, BEETLE
 JUICE is “SCREAMINGLY GOOD FUN!” (Variety). And under its uproarious s
 urface (six feet under\, to be exact)\, it’s a remarkably touching show 
 about family\, love\, and making the most of every Day-O!\nAge Recommendat
 ion: Recommended for 13+. Contains strong language and mature references.
 \nDates/times/programs/prices are subject to change.\n---------------\nWe 
 acknowledge these business members who support the Clemens Center programm
 ing throughout the year:\nArnot Health • Chemung Supply • Chemung Cana
 l Trust Company • Guthrie • Streeter Associates\n\nSource: FLXcalendar
  - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78507417/20261208193000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78507417/20261208193000
