BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening w/ Squirrel Nut Zippers - Christmas Caravan\, at Smith 
 Opera House
DTSTART:20261213T010000Z
DTEND:20261213T045959Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T170003Z
UID:5b85a713b9a80bde5bfaec02fd1d72f5946e25ec@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Holidays,Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:From Hot to the holidays: Squirrel Nut Zippers keep the 30th a
 nniversary celebration going with their festive Christmas Caravan tour.\nT
 he Squirrel Nut Zippers return with their beloved Christmas Caravan Tour\,
  bringing a festive blend of vintage jazz\, New Orleans swing\, folk tradi
 tions\, and holiday spirit to audiences nationwide. Following a successful
  year celebrating the 30th anniversary of their platinum-certified breakth
 rough album Hot with a special anniversary tour\, the band continues the c
 elebration by bringing their singular musical magic to the holiday season.
 \nPart holiday spectacular\, part musical time machine\, the Christmas Car
 avan combines seasonal classics\, fan-favorite selections from the band's 
 acclaimed Christmas Caravan album\, and highlights from the Squirrel Nut Z
 ippers' celebrated catalog. From heartwarming ballads and spirited sing-al
 ongs to rollicking dance numbers\, the show creates an atmosphere that fee
 ls equally at home beneath twinkling Christmas lights and inside a lively 
 Prohibition-era speakeasy.\nBox Office\, Tickets & Seating:\nNOTE: YOUR CO
 NFIRMATION EMAIL WILL NOT CONTAIN YOUR TICKET(S). You’ll receive an emai
 l 48 hours before your performance with your official\, scannable QR code.
  This process helps us prevent ticket scams.\nThe Smith’s box office wil
 l be open for in person of over the phone sales Tuesday-Friday from 10am-4
 pm. Online tickets can be purchased at any time. All over the phone or onl
 ine purchases will receive a digital ticket sent to your email. You must h
 ave a valid email to purchase tickets for this event.\nOur box office is l
 ocated at the Smith Opera House\, 82 Seneca St.\, Geneva NY\, 14456. We ca
 n be reached at (315) 781-5483 or boxoffice@thesmith.org.\nAll sales are f
 inal. The Smith does not offer refunds or exchanges nor do we resell ticke
 ts.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78501
 779/20261212200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78501779/20261212200000
END:VEVENT
